/*
  globalShortcuts.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 misc surface · 0002 · globalShortcuts (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `GlobalShortcuts` surface + catalog resolves (table "globalShortcuts") lives here with
  its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing
  the shared catalog.

  Group 1 — keys extracted verbatim from the web source (lib/globalShortcuts.tsx).
  Group 2 — the navigation destination labels (web `GOTO_SHORTCUTS[*].label`) interpolated
            into the `Go to %@` template.
  Group 3 — the palette command labels (web `commandRegistry` entries with a `shortcut`).
  Group 4 — native chrome: title, VoiceOver wording, and the P4 leaf freshness / loading /
            empty / error copy, so the Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

